Z||000000||RossT||08-22-2000||09:15 PM||||For years I have seen "car dollies" in the<BR>harbor freight catolog. Finally broke down and bought a set.  One can move your fiero with only one hand!! Fit your car into tight spots.. well worth the 100 buck for a set of four.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Image007.jpg"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Image002.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000001||Monkeyman||08-22-2000||10:04 PM||||They are cool, but they make the car handle terribly.  Good gas mileage, poor braking and cornering.  Your choice.  Personally, I'd rather invest in something else if I want to get better mileage.||||reg||1
Z||000002||mrfiero||08-22-2000||11:15 PM||||Hey Ross.....nice looking GT's.   That red one looks awfully familiar.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>I have been wanting to buy a set of those dollies for some time now....I'll have to get a set.  Barc wants some too, but he'll need about 50 sets to do any good!!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  ||||reg||10
Z||000003||RossT||08-22-2000||11:41 PM||||Harbor Freight puts them on sale from time to time.  They also have free shipping. They really are heavy duty!! I can grab the support beam, and move the car all by myself.<P>Mike, Notice the shine on the red one.  It took a while to get 12 years of fall out off, but man does it look nice.<P>Ross||||reg||1
Z||000004||mshill||08-23-2000||12:40 AM||||RossT,  How do you keep your garage/shop that clean.  My wife seems to think that everything that she can't find a spot for in the house (2400 sq ft.) ends up in my garage.<BR>It's about 800 sq feet (25'x32') but I can barely get two cars in it.||||reg||8
Z||000005||RossT||08-23-2000||11:13 PM||||MS, My philosophy is that if the stuff makes the garage look clutered, it goes in the house or in the trash!!!<P>I actually have one of those plastic closet sheds in the back yard, that the seasonal stuff goes into. (snow shovel etc...)||||reg||1
Z||000006||mshill||08-24-2000||12:07 AM||||My wife cannot leave town without me because she is afraid I will clean the garage... that means put my stuff away and throw everything else out.||||reg||1
